      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.04,
      "end_seconds": 237.12,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 85, respiratory rate 14. And pressure 124 over 73, temperature 36.7."
