      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.87,
      "end_seconds": 268.7,
      "duration_seconds": 13.83,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: I don't have a clear answer today: a venous leg ulcer is possible, and so is an arterial ulcer."
