      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.01,
      "end_seconds": 294.01,
      "duration_seconds": 21.0,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like a venous leg ulcer, but I'd like to confirm let's get a wound swab, for leg ulcer let's plan a check in two weeks can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
